{"id":"xkkvlbzvo8y3dcf51k29w9vds","title":"GLP-1类药物对大脑认知功能的影响","originalTitle":"热门减肥药可能对大脑产生出人意料的影响","summary":"诺和诺德的EVOKE和EVOKE+临床试验显示，司美格鲁肽虽能改变阿尔茨海默病相关生物标志物，但未能延缓疾病进展。哥德堡大学与哥本哈根大学的研究人员在《Science》发表综述，探讨GLP-1药物是否能保护认知功能，指出需确认药物对大脑的直接作用与代谢状况改善的间接效果。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=41174&do=blog&id=1561094"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T00:08:29.998Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T00:08:29.998Z","category":"clinical","tags":["研究成果","阿尔茨海默"],"score":31,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"alzheimers","name":"阿尔茨海默与神经退行"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}